{"version":1,"content":"<p>陳奕迅（Eason）為慶祝踏入樂壇30周年，首度將錄音室搬上舞台，將於今年12月至明年2月在香港演藝學院歌劇院舉行26場《Recording Sessions with Mr. Eason Chan 與陳奕迅一起錄音》，邀請歌迷現場見證經典歌曲重新誕生。</p><p>陳奕迅昨日（17日）於社交平台發文，親自解構選址演藝學院的背後原因，直言該處對他意義特別重大。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T04:58:38.233780+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T04:36:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T23:17:32.778656+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T04:57:33.747770+00:00","content_hash":"b9b83fe8087b5827558c4938fc454814c4553335d65e45236c34fc7ff0358e2e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}